OL,3,GNEWSADisruption warning amid huge
OL,4,Asecurity operation in Dublin for EU
OL,5,Ameetings
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe public is being warned to expect
OL,8,Ftraffic disruption in Dublin this week,
OL,9,Fas the Irish capital hosts two major
OL,10,FEuropean Union presidency events on
OL,11,FThursday and Friday.
OL,13,FThe Republic of Ireland has been
OL,14,Fchairing the EU presidency since 1 July
OL,15,Fand will continue to do so until 31
OL,16,FDecember.
OL,18,FThis has led to Ireland being the
OL,19,Fmeeting place for many political
OL,20,Fleaders from across the EU in recent
OL,21,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
