OL,3,GNEWSADisruption warning amid huge
OL,4,Asecurity operation in Dublin for EU
OL,5,Ameetings
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe two main showpieces of the EU
OL,8,Fpresidency will be a meeting of the
OL,9,FEuropean Political Community (EPC) on
OL,10,FThursday 12 November and an informal
OL,11,Fmeeting of the European Council the
OL,12,Ffollowing day.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
